",\n        \"Provider metadata record CTD wire interference editing and missing bins. The hourly product has no per-cell native editing history; nulls and joint support are retained.\",\n        \"100\u2013300m follows the published regional comparison, not an assumed depth-independent current width.\",\n        \"Track includes small northward steps and a two-hour gap. Preserve acquisition order; do not silently form a single monotone width crossing.\",\n        \"Northern and southern branch windows follow Chen and Firing(2006), section3 paragraph7. Windows are association context, not detected edges.\"\n      ],\n      \"citation\": \"University of Hawaii / NOAA JASADCP, SAC_ID00016, Gunnar Roden, processed E.Kestenare and E.Firing. Chen,S.,and E.Firing(2006), JGR111,C03001, doi:10.1029/2005JC003064.\",\n      \"calculation_readback_protocol\": \"plans/scientific-calculation-readback-protocol-v1.md\"\n    },\n    \"schema\": \"osw.hydrography-correspondence.v1\",\n    \"status\": \"observed_metadata_correspondence_pending_named_flow_and_boundary_review\",\n    \"current_id\": \"aleutian\",\n    \"input_sha256\": {\n      \"research/source-data/cchdo-p14n-1993/cruise-page.html\": \"98583d9aba689bcf8ddfe7e8079aa5c6218af5e6921c84c2cd5a5aded814d5d4\",\n      \"research/source-data/cchdo-p14n-1993/ctd-original.nc\": \"290d184ab64e0bf07d7dc1a208f34ccd3da765b22176d9392c6b907941234ad2\",\n      \"research/source-data/cchdo-p14n-1993/cruise-summary-original.txt\": \"2533722c212e74dcd58fcd990b6a97e682736cae68356732854786a15d7b82f1\",\n      \"research/source-data/cchdo-p14n-1993/cruise-report-original.txt\": \"b584d11abb3cab37aeeb2fe0584974672b6b9c2b21050319a392436377f12e78\",\n      \"research/source-data/cchdo-p14n-1993/acquisition.json\": \"6d9d9aad7a5e5fbe222bbdd00ca00b5d415aa0e75ed8a7def8aa19020e8d1b38\",\n      \"analysis/acquire_p14n_1993_ctd.py\": \"d12583061175b54befa2ccb0c4444ac8baff447421863ddcdf9bed4897d1efed\",\n      \"plans/aleutian-p14n-1993-hydrography-jo