"value":"About 1,400 km positive / 600 km negative; unranked"}],"figure_alt":"Two native-grid geostrophic-speed composites with direction arrows and all248unjoined coordinate means each, plus three separate source-clock coverage rows. Gray means missing source data. Coordinate means end below23.2N and do not form a complete Loop Current. No dimensions are admitted.","figure_file":"figures/loop-durante-2026-source-view.svg","figure_label":"Source composites and separate clocks","figure_sha256":"46ac25fb2cf7205f1bd1e113085126058f71148c442d3256dde04741a18a843e","finding":"Two processed surface-flow configurations are available. Separate gateway-connected contour paths measure about 1,400 km and 600 km. These conditional paths do not establish a ranked whole-current length or physical width; the supplied coordinate means remain incomplete.","geometry_role":"research_evidence_no_current_axis_or_physical_width_geometry","kind":"current_research_evidence","label":"Loop Current","new_width_record_admitted":false,"next_evidence":"Recover complete daily Loop axes or a validated gateway-connected algorithm before route/length admission; establish exact composite-member support before physical interpretation.","notes":["These are author-processed MCA phase composites, not dated snapshots, seasons or forecasts. Original daily Canek/CMEMS observations are not supplied in this compact archive.","The two coordinate means were formed with omitnan. Daily member coordinates and per-point support counts are unavailable; no full Loop axis or length is inferred.","The three source clocks are distinct. One tisp entry is missing at zero-based OSW position3462 (MATLAB index3463); it is not filled from tid. Original phase/grid selection indices remain one-based MATLAB indices. Calendar timezone is unspecified, and dates are source clocks rather than new current observations.","The area_loop and AMR_loop scalars remain unscaled under their original names. No width, length or occupied-current polygon is inferred from enclosed-area metrics.","The source API declares CC BY4.0 and version0. README retains a license-selection TODO, CITATION.cff says1.0.0, and the associated manuscript DOI is a placeholder; these documentary disagreements remain visible.","A separate fixed contour experiment measures the author-plotted absolute ADT guide between editorial gateways. All 54 level/gateway cases have one supported path; 18 disconnected closed-ring components are rejected. These conditional contour paths are not mean daily current lengths, annual extrema, confidence bounds or physical widths.","Calculated readbacks use a declared precision for reproducibility. That precision is not observational uncertainty or an annual range. Original source values, masks and quality flags remain unchanged; the exact record pins the calculation rules."],"original_url":"https://zenodo.org/records/22652650","rank_eligible":false,"source_file":"research/source-data/loop-durante-2026-v0/quality.json","source_links":[{"document":"research/source-data/loop-durante-2026-v0/quality.json","label":"Exact source schema and quality","pointer":""},{"document":"research/loop-durante-2026-source-view.json","label":"Exact composite fields and masks","pointer":"/phases"},{"document":"research/loop-durante-2026-source-view.json","label":"All original clocks","pointer":"/clocks"},{"document":"research/loop-durante-2026-source-view.json","label":"Unscaled source area scalars","pointer":"/source_scalar_series"},{"document":"research/source-data/loop-durante-2026-v0/acquisition.json","label":"Source custody and release notes","pointer":""},{"document":"research/loop-durante-2026-composite-contour-paths.json","label":"All 54 contour cases and complete velocity samples","pointer":"/cases"},{"document":"research/loop-durante-2026-composite-contour-paths.json","label":"Original contours before gateway clipping","pointer":"/source_contours"},{"document":"research/loop-durante-2026-composite-contour-paths.j